  "details": "In worlds like Murder 4 where users get teleported far away a lot, I've noticed that when users get teleported back occasionally their IK stays reduced for longer then necessary as well as voice transmission not working for some time also.\n\nTo test this, just join an active instance of Murder 4 and stay outside of the game area and observe players as they teleport in and out, it may happen eventually or right away.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_858dfdfc-1b48-4e1e-8a43-f0edc611e5fe\n\noutput log: https://files.catbox.moe/ezaxye.zip",
